    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/8bacc47451c392ebdb2c4ef5f2189bc9.avif?t=1748316855\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired as the new night security guard at this massive mart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple, walk the halls, check the offices, the store floor, and the warehouse, and activate all patrol panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever else happens during your shift\u2026 is not the company\u2019s concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.poster.avif?t=1748316855\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.webm?t=1748316855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.mp4?t=1748316855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must patrol the mart as instructed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol panels are located in the office, the store area, and the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate all of these panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once every panel is activated, your daily duty is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/03448bdd4a00172831b2d3a1d3bbe3b8.avif?t=1748316855\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the pentagram panels in the abandoned mart in the normal, inverted, or random order to experience multiple endings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/8bacc47451c392ebdb2c4ef5f2189bc9.avif?t=1748316855\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired as the new night security guard at this massive mart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple, walk the halls, check the offices, the store floor, and the warehouse, and activate all patrol panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever else happens during your shift\u2026 is not the company\u2019s concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.poster.avif?t=1748316855\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.webm?t=1748316855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/4f08c851be7094851d9ff2ae0fe9c697.mp4?t=1748316855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must patrol the mart as instructed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol panels are located in the office, the store area, and the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate all of these panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once every panel is activated, your daily duty is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/03448bdd4a00172831b2d3a1d3bbe3b8.avif?t=1748316855\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the pentagram panels in the abandoned mart in the normal, inverted, or random order to experience multiple endings.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the role of a night security guard and patrol the mart. Your duty is to activate patrol devices at each location. As you do, strange events begin to unfold. No matter what happens, complete your mission and uncover the truth.",
